  "releaseNotes": "### 🚀 Features\n\n* *(ripple)* Add Signal.autorun for effects owned by their scope ([afa168e](https://github.com/fable-hub/Fable.Ripple/commit/afa168e6d02a23a8795c2ac9afed0c903a54653a))\n\n### ⚡ Performance Improvements\n\n* *(ripple)* Register one edge for consecutive reads of the same source ([a382ebd](https://github.com/fable-hub/Fable.Ripple/commit/a382ebd90654fa3a4b8fd85d725cdb054f8f62d0))\n* *(ripple)* Return the scope and the effect as their own disposable ([5d32314](https://github.com/fable-hub/Fable.Ripple/commit/5d323148c615a794619e96ab3bfe004e5d16a73a))\n\n<strong><small>[View changes on Github](https://github.com/fable-hub/Fable.Ripple/compare/a4a9d66ac6e2262f4729837b527dd4ff44026e9d..a1ae7294270191c05de2b89d5fc60b714613558a)</small></strong>",
